00:08:11.241 --> 00:08:14.338
Ce qui satisfait visiblement
la plupart d'entre nous.

00:08:14.338 --> 00:08:16.683
Enfin surtout les gauchers ! Oui.

00:08:16.683 --> 00:08:18.272
86% des gauchers,

00:08:18.272 --> 00:08:20.053
je suis gauchère,

00:08:20.053 --> 00:08:24.630
